\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>\n像 TRL (<code>trl.PPOTrainer</code>) 这样的库大大简化了这些复杂性，但理解其底层结构是有益的。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>评估 (<code>src/evaluation/</code>)</strong>：实现函数或脚本，用于评估不同阶段的模型，特别是最终经过 PPO 微调的策略。这包括计算自动指标和准备用于人工评估的输出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>工具 (<code>src/utils/</code>)</strong>：放置通用辅助函数、日志设置、参数解析逻辑等，以避免代码重复。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>执行脚本 (<code>scripts/</code>)</strong>：这些是运行管道每个部分的执行入口。它们解析参数，加载配置，实例化 <code>src/training</code> 中所需的训练器类，并启动训练或评估过程。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>数据流和关系</h3>\n<p>下图说明了主要代码组件与数据/模型文件之间的高级关系。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-5abe72\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph RLHFPipelineStructure {\n    rankdir=LR;\n    node [shape=box, style=filled, fontname=\"Arial\", fontsize=10, margin=0.2];\n    edge [fontname=\"Arial\", fontsize=9];\n\n    subgraph cluster_config {\n        label=\"配置\";\n        style=filled;\n        color=\"#e9ecef\"; // gray\n        config [label=\"configs/\\n(YAML/JSON)\", fillcolor=\"#ced4da\"];\n    }\n\n    subgraph cluster_data {\n        label=\"数据\";\n        style=filled;\n        color=\"#a5d8ff\"; // blue light\n        sft_data [label=\"SFT 数据\\n(data/sft)\", fillcolor=\"#74c0fc\"];\n        pref_data [label=\"偏好数据\\n(data/preferences)\", fillcolor=\"#74c0fc\"];\n        prompts [label=\"提示词\\n(data/prompts)\", fillcolor=\"#74c0fc\"];\n    }\n\n    subgraph cluster_scripts {\n        label=\"执行脚本\";\n        style=filled;\n        color=\"#ffec99\"; // yellow light\n        run_sft [label=\"scripts/run_sft.py\", fillcolor=\"#ffe066\"];\n        run_rm [label=\"scripts/run_rm.py\", fillcolor=\"#ffe066\"];\n        run_ppo [label=\"scripts/run_ppo.py\", fillcolor=\"#ffe066\"];\n        run_eval [label=\"scripts/run_evaluation.py\", fillcolor=\"#ffe066\"];\n    }\n\n    subgraph cluster_src {\n        label=\"源代码 (src/)\";\n        style=filled;\n        color=\"#b2f2bb\"; // green light\n\n        subgraph cluster_trainers {\n            label=\"训练逻辑\";\n            style=filled;\n            color=\"#8ce99a\"; // green lighter\n            sft_trainer [label=\"sft_trainer.py\", fillcolor=\"#69db7c\"];\n            rm_trainer [label=\"rm_trainer.py\", fillcolor=\"#69db7c\"];\n            ppo_trainer [label=\"ppo_trainer.py\", fillcolor=\"#69db7c\"];\n        }\n\n        subgraph cluster_eval {\n            label=\"评估逻辑\";\n            style=filled;\n            color=\"#8ce99a\"; // green lighter\n            evaluator [label=\"evaluate_alignment.py\", fillcolor=\"#69db7c\"];\n        }\n\n        subgraph cluster_data_proc {\n            label=\"数据处理\";\n            style=filled;\n            color=\"#8ce99a\"; // green lighter\n            data_proc [label=\"data_processing/\", fillcolor=\"#69db7c\"];\n        }\n         utils [label=\"utils/\", fillcolor=\"#69db7c\"];\n    }\n\n    subgraph cluster_models {\n        label=\"模型文件 (models/)\";\n        style=filled;\n        color=\"#ffc9c9\"; // red light\n        base_model [label=\"基础 LLM\", fillcolor=\"#ffa8a8\"];\n        sft_model [label=\"SFT 模型\", fillcolor=\"#ffa8a8\"];\n        rm_model [label=\"奖励模型\", fillcolor=\"#ffa8a8\"];\n        ppo_policy [label=\"PPO 策略\", fillcolor=\"#ffa8a8\"];\n    }\n\n    // Connections\n    config -> {run_sft, run_rm, run_ppo, run_eval} [label=\"加载配置\"];\n    {sft_data, pref_data, prompts} -> data_proc [label=\"输入数据\"];\n    data_proc -> {sft_trainer, rm_trainer, ppo_trainer} [label=\"提供格式化数据\"];\n\n    run_sft -> sft_trainer;\n    run_rm -> rm_trainer;\n    run_ppo -> ppo_trainer;\n    run_eval -> evaluator;\n\n    sft_trainer -> base_model [label=\"加载\"];\n    sft_trainer -> sft_model [label=\"保存检查点\"];\n\n    rm_trainer -> sft_model [label=\"加载（可选初始化）\"];\n    rm_trainer -> rm_model [label=\"保存检查点\"];\n\n    ppo_trainer -> sft_model [label=\"加载初始策略/参考策略\"];\n    ppo_trainer -> rm_model [label=\"加载用于评分\"];\n    ppo_trainer -> ppo_policy [label=\"保存最终模型/检查点\"];\n\n    evaluator -> ppo_policy [label=\"加载用于评估\"];\n    evaluator -> pref_data [label=\"使用（可选）\"];\n    evaluator -> prompts [label=\"用于生成\"];\n\n    {sft_trainer, rm_trainer, ppo_trainer, evaluator, data_proc} -> utils [label=\"使用辅助函数\"];\n}' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-5abe72\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>RLHF 项目的高级结构，展示了配置、数据、可执行脚本、源代码模块（训练、评估、数据处理）和模型文件之间的关系。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>这种结构的好处</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>模块化</strong>：每个阶段（SFT、RM、PPO）都独立封装在其各自的训练器模块和执行脚本中。这使得调试或修改某个部分变得更容易，而不会影响其他部分。</li>\n<li><strong>配置驱动</strong>：通过更改 <code>configs/</code> 目录中的参数 (parameter)，可以轻松配置和复现实验。</li>\n<li><strong>明确分离</strong>：代码 (<code>src/</code>)、数据 (<code>data/</code>)、模型 (<code>models/</code>)、配置 (<code>configs/</code>) 和执行脚本 (<code>scripts/</code>) 之间明确分离，提高了组织性。</li>\n<li><strong>可重用性</strong>：工具函数 (<code>src/utils/</code>) 和数据处理逻辑 (<code>src/data_processing/</code>) 可以在不同阶段间共享。</li>\n<li><strong>可扩展性</strong>：虽然这种结构适用于单机开发，但它提供了一个基本框架，可以通过修改训练器和执行脚本来适配分布式训练环境。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>从一开始就采用这种结构化方法，将随着你的 RLHF 系统复杂性增加而节省大量精力，让你能够更专注于算法和建模方面的挑战，而不是处理杂乱的代码。</p>",
